where we are with that.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:20.440
Also, to provide
with Michael's help,

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:23.400
an example of how Two Sigma is
leveraging the Cloud Security

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.576
Command Center on their
