00:38:40.651 --> 00:38:41.900
and it sent them to Cloud SCC.

00:38:41.900 --> 00:38:45.350
So if we go back to
the console now--

00:38:45.350 --> 00:38:47.750
and I'll just
update this to now--

00:38:47.750 --> 00:38:49.850
we should see not
