00:46:55.510 --> 00:46:58.700
on the edge with your services.

00:46:58.700 --> 00:47:02.030
So let's take a look at a
little bit of a solution in more

00:47:02.030 --> 00:47:08.017
details and how it actually
works the integration itself.

00:47:08.017 --> 00:47:10.100
The first step with going
through the Google Cloud

00:47:10.100 --> 00:47:13.600
Platform [INAUDIBLE]

00:47:14.440 --> 00:47:18.880
With a simple click of
a button, the customer,

00:47:18.880 --> 00:47:21.550
like Two Sigma or
any other customer,

00:47:21.550 --> 00:47:25.270
creates an instance
of App Engine.

00:47:25.270 --> 00:47:28.810
And while it's created,
it also generates

00:47:28.810 --> 00:47:34.630
a unique public key URL that
will be used on the Cloudflare

00:47:34.630 --> 00:47:38.140
side to encrypt the data to send
them to Google Cloud Platform

00:47:38.140 --> 00:47:39.505
App Engine API.

00:47:39.505 --> 00:47:43.340
So all communication is
happening over [INAUDIBLE]..

00:47:43.340 --> 00:47:46.360
So let's move on Cloudflare
side to see what's

00:47:46.360 --> 00:47:49.690
happening on our edge.

00:47:49.690 --> 00:47:54.250
This case, in
Cloudflare UI, customer

00:47:54.250 --> 00:48:01.670
uses JavaScript, which is
run within the edge workers.

00:48:01.670 --> 00:48:04.460
So now you ask me, what
is actually edge workers?

00:48:04.460 --> 00:48:09.220
So while we're maintaining
security and performance

00:48:09.220 --> 00:48:12.430
aspects for our
customers, Cloudflare

00:48:12.430 --> 00:48:15.970
introduces an additional
functionality, Cloudflare Edge

00:48:15.970 --> 00:48:22.150
Workers, which allows you to
run the code on the edge instead

00:48:22.150 --> 00:48:26.490
of your server, which
immediately reveals

00:48:26.490 --> 00:48:30.850
a powerful functionality and
web extensibility by moving

00:48:30.850 --> 00:48:34.300
your logic from the server
all the way to the edge, which

00:48:34.300 --> 00:48:36.550
means you can i A/B
testing now, you

00:48:36.550 --> 00:48:40.430
can decide which traffic
you want to face it and test

00:48:40.430 --> 00:48:43.930
it and load balancing
it, also improving user

00:48:43.930 --> 00:48:47.770
experience that everything now
can run on the edge instead of,

00:48:47.770 --> 00:48:51.210
like, creating that
latency to get the compute

00:48:51.210 --> 00:48:54.490
and calculations on your
server and goes back and again.

00:48:54.490 --> 00:49:00.950
So that's a huge,
huge, huge advantage.

00:49:00.950 --> 00:49:03.010
So in this current
integration, you

00:49:03.010 --> 00:49:07.910
can see these edge worker
acts like a proxy--

00:49:07.910 --> 00:49:09.880
actually a very powerful proxy.

00:49:09.880 --> 00:49:13.780
What it does is actually
connects [INAUDIBLE] API

00:49:13.780 --> 00:49:17.530
to Cloudflare API to download
the logs, which is actually

00:49:17.530 --> 00:49:22.270
gathered from all our 150 data
centers, and sends it back

00:49:22.270 --> 00:49:26.110
to edge worker, where edge
worker encrypts this data

00:49:26.110 --> 00:49:29.020
with public key that we
got generated in App Engine

00:49:29.020 --> 00:49:34.570
instance and sends it to
Google Cloud Platform, where

00:49:34.570 --> 00:49:39.580
App Engine instance gets this
data and posts it through

00:49:39.580 --> 00:49:45.460
cloud SCC API to Cloud Command
Security Center dashboard.

00:49:45.460 --> 00:49:48.280
So it runs quite fast.

00:49:48.280 --> 00:49:53.200
And also very important that on
top of all that functionality,

00:49:53.200 --> 00:49:56.330
we very care about security
point, and this is where--

00:49:56.330 --> 00:49:58.270
very important--
both systems, they

00:49:58.270 --> 00:50:00.850
won't expose their
sensitive data.

00:50:00.850 --> 00:50:03.850
So a private API key
that's used by edge workers

00:50:03.850 --> 00:50:07.870
to download the data
from Cloudflare edges

00:50:07.870 --> 00:50:12.880
remains within the system,
as well as Google Cloud

00:50:12.880 --> 00:50:14.650
data as well.

00:50:14.650 --> 00:50:17.890
On top of that, we
have improved security

00:50:17.890 --> 00:50:23.290
by allowing to lock requests
come into Cloudflare edge

00:50:23.290 --> 00:50:25.960
only from Google ASN number.

