00:58:39.490 --> 00:58:42.970
that our devices and endpoint
solutions put in the data lake.

00:58:42.970 --> 00:58:45.550
And this has been
working for a while.

00:58:45.550 --> 00:58:48.010
So with that framework, we are
adding something more on top

00:58:48.010 --> 00:58:52.000
of that, which is providing
third parties a way--

00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:55.510
so third parties means
partners, other vendors,

00:58:55.510 --> 00:58:57.675
could be even competitors
